'  , add content ''Running Flows user tasks with timing, assignment, priority, and lane information for APEX task inbox display. This view is intended for direct use in APEX applications but can be used elsewhere as well.  Deprecated - use flow_apex_my'
||'_combined_task_list_vw instead, which combines with APEX native tasks and provides more metadata.''',
'  , add deprecation ''This view is deprecated and will be removed in a future release. Use flow_apex_my_combined_task_list_vw instead.''',
