'    pi_dgrm_name => ''Tutorial 2c - Inclusive Gateways'',',
'    pi_dgrm_short_description => ''Flows for APEX Tutorial 2c - Inclusive Gateways - takes process navigation one step further by introducing Inclusive Gateways, which allow you to have conditional parallel paths.'',',
'    pi_dgrm_description => ''**Overview:**  ',
'The Inclusive Gateway BPMN Model is a sophisticated business process management tool designed to enhance workflow efficiency. This model employs Business Process Model and Notation (BPMN) to provide organizations with a flexible and dynamic way to ma'
||'nage decision-making processes within workflow systems.',
'',
'**Key Features:**',
'',
'**Inclusive Gateway Functionality:**',
'',
'*   Combines the features of both Parallel and Exclusive Gateways.',
'*   Allows multiple forward paths to be activated based on set conditions.',
'*   Facilitates decision-making that requires concurrent task flows.',
'',
'**Gateway Routing Expressions:**',
'',
'*   Introduces a new methodology in version 22.2 for routing decision-making.',
'*   Uses PL/SQL expressions or functions to determine if a path should be taken.',
'*   Offers flexibility by allowing process variables to influence routing, enabling dynamic adjustments based on real-time data.',
'',
'**Gateway Routing Variables:**',
'',
'*   Provides an alternative methodology for route selection by directly setting path names to be taken.',
'*   Supports complex decision-making within workflows, tapping into process variables for tailored routing.',
'',
'**Default Path and Error Management:**',
'',
'*   Ensures a fallback mechanism with a default path, preventing process interruptions.',
'*   Built-in error handling to guide flow when no conditions are met.',
'',
'**Script Task Capabilities:**',
'',
'*   Integrates PL/SQL procedures for robust routing logic.',
'*   Allows database queries or calculations to dynamically determine routing paths.',
'',
'**Applications:**  ',
'The model is ideal for enterprises requiring complex decision-making capabilities within their workflows. It is particularly beneficial where concurrent tasks must be managed with precision, such as in supply chain operations, customer service proces'
||'ses, and project management workflows.',
'',
'**Benefits:**',
'',
'*   Increases operational efficiency by allowing multiple task flows to be executed in parallel.',
'*   Enhances flexibility and responsiveness in decision-making processes.',
'*   Reduces errors and ensures continuity in business operations.',
'*   Provides powerful customization options to tailor workflows to specific organizational needs.',
'',
'**Conclusion:**  ',
'The Inclusive Gateway BPMN Model delivers a cutting-edge solution for businesses aiming to optimize process efficiency and adaptability. By leveraging advanced gateway functionalities, organizations can enhance their workflows'''' flexibility, ensuring'
||' that business processes align closely with operational demands and strategic objectives.'',',
