'      ,q''[]''',
'      ,q''[Each object in the Flow diagram can set a group of Process Variables before and after* it executes - so you can use this to keep track of process state, set gateway routing variables, hand keep track of things like who started the process, '
||'when you need it to finish, its priority or sensitivity, as well as run counters or other control variables.]''',
'      ,q''[]''',
'      ,q''[Variable Expressions can set process variables to static values, copy another variable, do a SQL query, evaluate an expression or a PL/SL function body.]''',
